title: Army Expansion Program
subtitle: A political question
tags: event, govt_affairs
is-card: true
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_seen = 1
face-image: img/armyexpansion.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_seen = 0 and year = 1927 and month >= 2 and reichswehr_minister_party != "RSDRP" and rsdrp_in_government = 1
new-page: true

= Army Expansion Program

The War Ministry and President Kornilov are demanding we continue the expansion of the Army's armored and land forces, a project that began under the previous Liberal-Narodist Government. The Esers are split, but Kerensky's word is enough to sway a majority of them into supporting the project. While many of our members are vehemently against new military spending, this vote may be necessary to preserve the coalition. 
We campaigned on food and welfare instead of tanks and rifles. Will we really betray our campaign promises?

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for funding the armament program.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against the armament program.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.

@vote_yes
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; rkp_coalition_dissent += 1; rkp_relation -= 6; workers_rsdrp -= 3; psr_right += 2

Our grassroots party members are shocked by our intransigence! Many party branches have begun agitating against the cabinet, and our Duma members even plan a full vote on the proposal, contravening the government's decision.

The campaign against the battlecruiser fails, with only the dissident RSDRP and RKP members voting against. The ship will be built.

@vote_no
on-arrival: kadets_relation -= 8; psr_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1; psr_left += 2; rkp_concil += 1
go-to: vote_no_does_not_pass rsdrp_r + rkp_r + peacesr_r < 50; vote_no_pass if rsdrp_r + rkp_r + peacesr_r >= 50

@vote_no_does_not_pass
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent); panzerkreuzer_failed = 1; workers_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rkp_relation += 2

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence while the pacifists of the party rejoice! Government Chairman [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a Duma vote, which fails through the combined forces of the RSDRP, anti-militarist Esers, and the RKP. The military will not be expanded!

@vote_no_pass
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; nationalism += 3*(1-dissent)

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence! Government Chairman [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a Duma vote, which passes with all parties in favor except the RSDRP and RKP. The program will be funded.

@abstain
on-arrival: kadets_relation -= 5; psr_relation -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; panzerkreuzer_funded = 1; rkp_relation -= 3

Our coalition partners are shocked by our intransigence and the party's pacifists are angered. Despite our abstention, the vote in the Duma goes through, with all parties in favor except the RSDRP and RKP. The program will be funded.
